<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung in Russian helicopter sales deal.</title>
<headline>Samsung in Russian helicopter sales deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsung Aerospace Industries Co Ltd said on Thursday it had signed an agreement with Russia's Rostvertol to be the sole agent for its Mi-26 helicopter in Asia-Pacific.</p>
<p>The two companies would cooperate on sales, after-sales support and modernisation of the helicopter model, a statement from the Samsung Group unit said.</p>
<p>It also said Samsung had agreed to buy a Mi-26 heavylift helicopter at $12 million from the Russian company for delivery by January.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 7275645</p>
</text>
